	quest.0C11EC34D5FA508B.title: "End Stone"
	quest.0CC92E94D10E681D.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble a iron reagent (kubejs:substrate_iron). The jar ingredient is dust iron (immersiveengineering:dust_iron)."
		"The sequence is an open jar, that ingredient deployed in, then a wooden slab as the lid. It sits on the wool row."
		"Four reagents from one row, in the Alchemical Laser, are the world's seed-rolled recipe for that row's catalyst. Ponder the laser. JEI has the jar. The tome does not."
	]
	quest.0CE88FEA070DC46C.quest_desc: ["{cabin.quest.0CE88FEA070DC46C.description1}"]
	quest.0CE88FEA070DC46C.title: "Computer Advanced"
	quest.0D146AD9FE774F8B.quest_desc: ["{cabin.quest.0D146AD9FE774F8B.description1}"]
	quest.0D146AD9FE774F8B.title: "Log"
	quest.0D739DC45906A4EB.quest_desc: ["eek"]
	quest.0D739DC45906A4EB.title: "rat_parts"
	quest.0DCC71420C57E089.quest_desc: [
		"It's said that once in every Cactoid's life, he enters a strange mood and seeks out rare organic materials. In this temporary state, the Cactoid's genetically-engineered instincts let it fuse biology with metal to forge a unique living tool, a phenomenon known as \"biosmithing\"."
		"Your instincts cry out - this crossbow could be something more, if only you had the right parts! You sense the need for tentacles, yes... giant orange tentacles, from a leviathan of the deep sea! But even if such a beast existed in this world, you might never find it..."
		"Plan B: slaughter enough fish, rip open their guts, and surely you'd find a few decent tentacles in their stomachs."
	]
	quest.0DCC71420C57E089.title: "Fish Fear Me"
