	quest.566E72AE7D580917.quest_desc: [
		"Have a silver reagent (kubejs:substrate_silver). It is not in the jar grid. Silicon and silver are the two reagents outside the seven rows."
		"The Alchemical Laser's chaos pairing can produce them. Ponder the laser. NuclearCraft's extractor pulls silicon or silver dust back out of the reagent. That is the wrong direction for this quest."
		"The Akashic Tome does not document this. JEI shows the extractor. The laser ponder is the setup."
	]
